# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, an editor or a WSL/Windows round-trip rewrites every file as
# CRLF and `git status` reports the entire tree as modified — 3,000+ changed
# lines with no content change. Real edits then become impossible to find, which
# is how a genuinely corrupted file slipped through review once already.
*         text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must be LF regardless of platform; CRLF makes them unrunnable
# with a "bad interpreter" error that names the right file and the wrong reason.
*.sh      text eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.pdf     binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.ico     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary

# Generated. Collapse in diffs; nobody reviews it line by line.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
